<title>AUSTRIA: Kohl says Germany to qualify for a punctual EMU.</title>
<headline>Kohl says Germany to qualify for a punctual EMU.</headline>
<dateline>BAD HOFGASTEIN, Austria 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chancellor Helmut Kohl told ARD television on Thursday that Germany would meet tough fiscal targets for Europe's planned single currency and that the euro would be launched punctually in 1999.</p>
<p>Kohl said it was &quot;extremely difficult&quot; to both fulfil the criteria and stick to the timetable. But he added that he was certain Germany would be able to achieve this, despite widespread doubts.</p>
</text>
